  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The dimension of magnetic induction is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, the dimension of magnetic flux is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>&#981;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;the dimension of magnetic permeability,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and, the dimension of magnetization,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p>"
